          "name": "What certifications and standards do you reference?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS references NIST 800-88 for media sanitization and can structure documentation around HIPAA privacy safeguards, California e-waste requirements, and project-specific procurement procedures. Ask which records apply to your equipment, industry, and disposition plan. Standards are applied according to the equipment, data type, customer policy, and requested documentation for each project."
