          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What areas do you serve?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS serves Bakersfield, Kern County, and organizations across the Central Valley through scheduled commercial logistics. Pickup planning can cover offices, campuses, clinics, agricultural operations, warehouses, and government facilities with qualifying equipment volumes. The service model is designed for organizations that need coordinated removal rather than a household drop-off option."
