            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Timing depends on equipment volume, access requirements, route availability, and project scope. Contact STS with your preferred window so the team can review logistics and discuss available scheduling for Bakersfield. Same-week scheduling may be available when the project details and route requirements align."
